	(text "6.14 suite: USBLC6-2SC6 on D+/D-/VBUS + MPZ2012S601AT000 VBUS bead;\nVBUS ORs into pre-eFuse +5VSB through D3 (SS34); CC1/CC2 5.1k = UFP sink.\nD+/D- leave this sheet as USB_HOST_D_P/N globals INTO the sheet-07 TS3USB221\ngate -- the host NEVER sees the compute module's USB directly (P4 in the\ncontrol path; OE# default-disconnected)."
